OL,3,AJemima Goldsmith accuses Russell Brand
OL,4,Aof violence and abuse against her
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning - this report contains graphic
OL,7,Fcontent.
OL,9,FJemima Goldsmith, the ex-girlfriend of
OL,10,FRussell Brand, has accused him of
OL,11,F"violence, coercive control and abuse"
OL,12,Fwhile the two were together.
OL,14,FGoldsmith, who dated the disgraced
OL,15,Fentertainer for roughly a year around
OL,16,F2014, alleged that she "had to call the
OL,17,Fpolice to have him removed from my
OL,18,Fhouse in 2014 during a violent
OL,19,Fincident" but chose not to press
OL,20,Fcharges.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
