OL,3,AJemima Goldsmith accuses Russell Brand
OL,4,Aof violence and abuse against her
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a lengthy statement on social media,
OL,7,Fthe 52-year-old said she was "in awe of
OL,8,Fthe courageous women who came forward
OL,9,Fat Brand's trial" and was "glad and
OL,10,Frelieved" he had "finally faced
OL,11,Fjustice".
